/* **************************************************************************
ASWUnitTests_Icon.rc
Author: Anthony S. West - ASW Software

Embeds the ASWUnitTests icon in the CMake builds of the console runner and
the Win32 GUI runner (MSVC, MinGW and Clang). The RAD Studio projects embed
the same .ico themselves (Icon_MainIcon), also as MAINICON, which is the
name the Win32 GUI runner loads it by. The .ico is found through the
include path, which has this folder.

